{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/41243-suggestions-for-experience-costs","id":41243,"title":"Suggestions for Experience Costs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-02T12:33:40-08:00","id":41243,"title":"Suggestions for Experience Costs","content":"I have been out of the WoD loop for about 6 months due to running and playing other games. I remember that the old forums had great suggestions for different experience costs of traits as well as a system for two types of experience, one for game play and one for role playing. Unfortunately, I do not remember exactly everything.<br /> <br /> I am writing out my own experience errata for my players and I think it looks pretty good but I have been playing and running games long enough to know that someone is doing it better. I also worry about balancing the new costs with tribe abilities and such. Here is what I was thinking, any suggestions would be appreciated. <br /> EXPERIENCE POINT COSTS<br /> Trait Cost<br /> Attribute New dots x 4<br /> Skill New dots x 2<br /> Skill Specialty 2<br /> Affinity (tribe, auspice ) New dots x 3<br /> Gift or Rituals<br /> Other Gift New dots x 5<br /> Rite Rite dots x 2<br /> Merit New dots x 2<br /> Totem Merit 3 per dot<br /> Primal Urge 8 experience points<br /> Primary Renown New dots x 4<br /> Other Renown New dots x 6<br /> Harmony New dots x 2<br /> Willpower 8 experience points<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1883-face_plont","name":"Face_Plont","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1883_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value